   "pages": 3,
   "template": true,
   "raw": "Page 1\nXG-82-2_V.2.3\nEthernet\n8 x 10/100/1000 Mbps\nSFP\n2 x SFP, 2.5Gbps\nConsole\nSerial console (Optional)\nStatus LED\nPWR(On/Off), LAN Activity LED (Green: Active\nconnection, Amber: 1000 Mbps), PoE Out LED, SFP Status LED, SYS LED.\nPoE Standard\n802.3at & 802.3af, Remote power and Data feeding up to 100m\nPoE Budget (Per Port)\n30 W (Max)\nTotal PoE Budget\n240 W(Max)\nPower Connector\nOption 1: 2 x Screw Terminal block\nOption 2: Spring Loaded 2 Pin Terminal block and DC Jack\nInput Voltage Range\n44-57 Vdc\nPower Consumption\nIdle :6 W\nFull Load: 250 W\nEnclosure\nIndustrial Aluminium Enclosure / Sheet Metal\nMounting\nOption 1: Din rail Mount\nOption 2: Table Top\nDesign\nFanless\nDimensions\n200 mm x 120 mm x 55mm (WxLxH)\nWeight\n675 Gm (Industrial Aluminium Enclosure)\nLayer\nLayer 2\nManagement Type\nManaged\nSmart Managed Switch\nYes\nSwitching Capacity\n20 Gbps\nMAC Address table entries\n8K\nPacket Forwarding Rate\n14.88 Mpps\nPacket Buffer Size\n4 Mbit\nJumbo Frame\n15K Byte\nVLAN\n32\nBasic Function\nCompatible with IEEE 802.3AF/AT compliant Powered Devices (PD)\nWire-speed forwarding\nMAC self-learning and aging\nIEEE802.3X Full-duplex and backpressure for half-duplex mode\nXG-82-2L Managed Switch\nDATA SHEET\nPRODUCT INFO\nINTERFACE\n8x 10/100/1000, 2x SFP\nPOWER\nDual Input: 44-57 VDC\nHardware Specification\nPoE & POWER BUDGET\n240 W (Max)\nFeatures\nPage 2\nXG-82-2_V.2.3\nUI Options of XG-82-2\nSpanning Tree Protocol\nSupport 802.1d STP\nSupport 802.1S（MSTP）\nSecurity\nMAC Manage, Strom Control, Traffic Monitoring, DHCP Snooping\nQoS\nQoS Basic, QoS Advance (802.1p)\nSwitch Monitoring and Management\nWeb, CLI (Console Port, Telnet, SSH), SNMP V1/V2, Support trap: cold start,\nwarm start, link down and link up\nEEE\nSupport Energy-Efficient Ethernet (EEE) function (IEEE802.3az)\nPoE\nPOE configuration, POE scheduling management, etc.\nVLAN Function\nPort-based VLAN, Tag based VLAN (802.1Q)\nDHCP Function\nDHCP Snooping, DHCP Relay\nManaged Features\nIGMP Snooping, LAG, Port Mirror, LLDP Config, LLDP Neighbour, Loop\nPrevention, ERPS.\nDiagnostics\nPing Tool, Cable diagnostics\nConfiguration Utility\nImport and Export Configuration backup\nStorage Temperature\n-30 ~ 70 °C\nOperating Temperature\n0~ 60 °C\nHumidity\n10 ~ 90% (non-condensing)\nOption 1: Switch, 2x TB Connectors and Din Rail.\nOption 2: Switch, 1x TB Connector.\nOperational & Environmental\nStandard Packaging\nImages\nPage 3\nXG-82-2_V.2.3\nOption 1: Table Top\nOption 2: Din Rail\n*All rights reserved, subject to change without prior notice.\nGet in touch:\nsales@invendis.com\nwww.silbonetworks.com https://invendis.com/\nInvendis Technologies India Private Limited\nNo. 230, 1st Cross, 38th Main, BOOHBCS Layout, BTM\n2nd Stage, Bangalore – 560 068"
  }
